@meeting crossingBackAddress.go
// The Captain's final address, Go (E-1, EN2; plans/ending-spec.html): after the oath. She names your choice to the
// crew: "Monday, we lose them to the Concord". A stand-in for SW6's words.
title: The Captain's address
from: Captain Odile Marrow
gist: The Captain told the crew you're leaving for Concord headquarters on Monday.
== lines
marrow: One more thing, and then the supper. Headquarters offered {me} a post, and they said yes.   [gesture]
marrow: Monday, we lose them to the Concord. The Tern leaves at ten. I expect the shuttle bay full.
tomas: Monday? This Monday?
marrow > you: We'll make it a proper send-off. Until then, you're still ours.   [nod]
